<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended Nov 23 totalled 126.210 million, versus a revised 120.177 million in the previous week and 125.831 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 167.134 million, versus a revised 165.065 million the previous week and 169.350 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
</text>
